{"name":"Elden Ring Orange","hex":"#ed8a09","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"elden","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To advance in eld or old age; to grow older; to age."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Rare form of olden."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/elden"},{"term":"ring","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A solid object in the shape of a circle.\nA circumscribing object, (roughly) circular and hollow, looking like an annual ring, earring, finger ring etc.","A circumscribing object, (roughly) circular and hollow, looking like an annual ring, earring, finger ring etc."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To enclose or surround.","To make an incision around; to girdle; to cut away a circular tract of bark from a tree in order to kill it."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ring"},{"term":"orange","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An evergreen tree of the genus Citrus such as Citrus sinensis which yields oranges (the fruit).","Any round citrus fruit with a yellow-red colour when ripe and a sour-sweet taste; the fruit of the orange tree.\n Specifically, a sweet orange or Citrus sinensis."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having the colour of the fruit of an orange tree; yellowred; reddish-yellow."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/orange"}],"entries":[{"title":"Elden Ring","blocks":[{"text":"Elden Ring is a 2022 action role-playing game directed by Hidetaka Miyazaki with worldbuilding provided by the American fantasy writer George R. R. Martin. Developed by FromSoftware and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment, it was first released on February 25, 2022, for PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Windows, Xbox One, and Xbox Series X/S with a Nintendo Switch 2 version released on August 28, 2026. Set in the Lands Between, players control a customizable player character on a quest to repair the Elden Ring and become the new Elden Lord."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b9/Elden_Ring_Box_art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elden_Ring"},{"title":"Orange (colour)","blocks":[{"text":"Orange is the colour between yellow and red on the spectrum of visible light. The human eyes perceive orange when observing light with a dominant wavelength between roughly 585 and 620 nanometres. In traditional colour theory, it is a secondary colour of pigments, produced by mixing yellow and red. In the RGB colour model, it is a tertiary colour. It is named after the fruit of the same name."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Delicatearch.png/330px-Delicatearch.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orange_(colour)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4b/Elden_Ring_gameplay.png/330px-Elden_Ring_gameplay.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4b/Elden_Ring_gameplay.png/330px-Elden_Ring_gameplay.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The player fighting a dragon while riding their steed Torrent","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AElden_Ring_gameplay.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Hidetaka_Miyazaki%2C_The_Game_Awards_2022_%28cropped%29.png/500px-Hidetaka_Miyazaki%2C_The_Game_Awards_2022_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Hidetaka_Miyazaki%2C_The_Game_Awards_2022_%28cropped%29.png/500px-Hidetaka_Miyazaki%2C_The_Game_Awards_2022_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHidetaka_Miyazaki%2C_The_G